/** \defgroup parser_compilation Source compilation
 * Compile complete UTF-8 string views into owned, reusable runtime programs.
 * See \ref parser_get_started for typed and owning results, stack reuse,
 * source lifetime, and execution examples.
 */

/** \defgroup parser_diagnostics Source diagnostics
 * Classify compilation failures and locate them with half-open UTF-8 byte
 * intervals. Client-emitter and execution exceptions propagate independently.
 */

/** \defgroup parser_extensions Extension libraries
 * Register exact operation signatures, opaque types, nominal record schemas,
 * ordinary function names, and persistent scopes before creating a compiler.
 * See \ref parser_libraries "Add an extension library" for the registration APIs.
 */
